  "chunks_draft": [
    "In New Mexico,",
    "if you're walking home",
    "alone after midnight,",
    "and a woman",
    "in black is standing",
    "at the crossroads...",
    "#keep walking.",
    "Because she isn't waiting",
    "for a ride.",
    "She's waiting to tell",
    "you who's next.",
    "They call her",
    "La Mala Hora.",
    "The evil hour.",
    "Her story is told",
    "in Hispanic communities across",
    "New Mexico,",
    "where white crosses",
    "called descansos line",
    "the back roads.",
    "Each one marks",
    "a place where someone",
    "died.",
    "According to the legend,",
    "she appears to people",
    "traveling alone at night,",
    "right where two roads",
    "meet.",
    "She never touches you.",
    "She doesn't have to.",
    "But here's the terrifying",
    "part.",
    "Seeing her doesn't mean",
    "you'll die.",
    "It means someone",
    "you love will.",
    "One woman saw",
    "her at a crossroads.",
    "By morning,",
    "she learned her husband",
    "had died...",
    "at that exact hour.",
    "They say she doesn't",
    "always look human.",
    "Sometimes she's just",
    "a dark shape rolling",
    "across the road.",
    "So if you're walking",
    "home alone tonight,",
    "don't stop,",
    "and don't look back.",
    "Because she isn't there",
    "for you.",
    "She's there to tell",
    "you who's not coming",
    "home."
  ]
